    {
      "handle": "adammccalvy.bsky.social",
      "author": "Adam McCalvy",
      "team": "ブルワーズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "The Brewers are in St. Pete with a two games to none lead in the World Series, and their favorite Robin flew along. “Hey, I waited 44 years for this!” Hall of Famer Robin Yount said. “I am not missing a game.” www.mlb.com/news/brewers...",
      "likes": 58,
      "reposts": 4,
      "replies": 3,
      "at": "2026-10-26T00:05:20.082Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:idooavtb3a4mlluqclqzel5p/app.bsky.feed.post/3myqgeyo64k22",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ブルワーズはワールドシリーズで2連勝し、舞台のセントピーターズバーグへ。愛するロビンも同行した。「44年待ったんだ!1試合も見逃さないよ」と殿堂入りのロビン・ヨーント。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
      "author": "Andy Kostka",
      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "Cedric Mullins with a World Series hit",
      "likes": 33,
      "reposts": 7,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-10-27T03:04:13.567Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3mytatsexyk2v",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "セドリック・マリンズにワールドシリーズ初安打"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
      "author": "Andy Kostka",
      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "I know trade incentives and payroll considerations and roster construction and all of that — yes, I know. But damn, Cedric was an Oriole",
      "likes": 36,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-10-27T03:08:09.679Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3mytb2tkh6s2v",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "トレードの条件も年俸総額もロスター構成も、もちろん分かってる。それでも、セドリックはオリオールズの選手だったんだよな"
    },
    {
      "handle": "samdykstramilb.bsky.social",
      "author": "Sam Dykstra",
      "team": "全国",
      "outlet": "MLB Pipeline",
      "text": "I want to be clear on this: I am very much on the “Get Brandon Woodruff a World Series appearance” train",
      "likes": 31,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 3,
      "at": "2026-10-27T02:06:47.270Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:bdxjovzqrf4q66ptu3dplmeb/app.bsky.feed.post/3myt5n3qekk24",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "はっきり言っておく。「ブランドン・ウッドラフをワールドシリーズのマウンドへ」派だ"
    },
    {
      "handle": "samdykstramilb.bsky.social",
      "author": "Sam Dykstra",
      "team": "全国",
      "outlet": "MLB Pipeline",
      "text": "The 2026 Milwaukee Brewers remain, in a word, relentless.",
      "likes": 27,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-10-27T01:38:16.078Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:bdxjovzqrf4q66ptu3dplmeb/app.bsky.feed.post/3myt423suo22u",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "2026年のミルウォーキー・ブルワーズは、ひと言で言えば容赦ない。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "adammccalvy.bsky.social",
      "author": "Adam McCalvy",
      "team": "ブルワーズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Jim Gasser was drafted by the Brewers in 1984. Now his son Robert is starting for the Brewers in the World Series. It's a time of stress and joy and pride for the whole family. \"I don’t know how he does it. I don’t know how anybody does it.” www.mlb.com/brewers/news...",
      "likes": 23,
      "reposts": 1,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-10-26T15:57:13.928Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:idooavtb3a4mlluqclqzel5p/app.bsky.feed.post/3mys3l4oge22t",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ジム・ガッサーは1984年にブルワーズからドラフト指名された。今、息子のロバートがワールドシリーズでブルワーズの先発を務める。一家にとって緊張と喜びと誇りの時間だ。「どうやってるのか分からない。誰にだって無理だよ」"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "A year ago, everyone else was looking up at the #BlueJays, trying to recreate their magic. Things have changed. What can they take now from the Rays and Brewers? www.mlb.com/bluejays/new...",
      "likes": 16,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 3,
      "at": "2026-10-26T15:05:27.930Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3myryokkv6k2u",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Maybe learn how to play baseball.  Might not be a bad idea.",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "ah-fars.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Their entire team and management.",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "habs1993.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "No mention of Ricky Tiedemann?",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "pmadridb.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "1年前、他球団は#BlueJaysを見上げ、あの魔法の再現を狙っていた。状況は変わった。彼らはレイズとブルワーズから何を学べるか?"
    },
